sp {kenken*apply*print-row
   (state <s> ^operator <o>
              ^printed-rows <old>)
   (<o> ^name print-row
        ^row-number { <r> <> <old> }
        ^cell1.mark <m1>
        ^cell2.mark <m2>
        ^cell3.mark <m3>
        ^cell4.mark <m4>
        ^cell5.mark <m5>
        ^cell6.mark <m6>)
-->
   (<s> ^printed-rows <old> -
        ^printed-rows <r>)
   (write |\| | <m1> | \| | <m2> | \| | <m3> | \| | <m4> | \| | <m5> | \| | <m6> | \| |)
}
